827666,"text":"（ヴィマラ村の「悪者」を見つけ出そう。）","nextNodeIds":[730800102]},{"nodeId":730800102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3595481778,"text":"こんにちは、アルフォンソ！","nextNodeIds":[730800103]},{"nodeId":730800103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":3842335770,"text":"#君たちか。{NICKNAME}、何か用か？ラナを探してるのなら、彼女はもう行ったよ。","nextNodeIds":[730800104]},{"nodeId":730800104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3851660418,"text":"相談したいことがある——","nextNodeIds":[730800105]},{"nodeId":730800105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2500675282,"text":"ヴィマラ村に潜んでいる「悪者」について。","nextNodeIds":[730800106]},{"nodeId":730800106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":904062018,"text":"#ああ。{NICKNAME}が悪者を片付けるって約束したから、ラナも安心して旅に出られたんだもんな。","nextNodeIds":[730800107]},{"nodeId":730800107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":2507695066,"text":"…そうか。分かった、心当たりはないが、聞きたいことがあれば聞いてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[730800108]},{"nodeId":730800108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":710180890,"text":"まず、状況を整理しよう。","nextNodeIds":[730800109]},{"nodeId":730800109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2554576698,"text":"それじゃ…ヴィマラ村で最初にいなくなった子供は誰だ？","nextNodeIds":[730800110,730800111,730800113,730800116]},{"nodeId":730800110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":824760490,"text":"スダッベ。","nextNodeIds":[730800119]},{"nodeId":730800119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4201198426,"text":"おう、オイラも思い出したぞ！スダッベだ！アマディアじいちゃんの目に効く薬草があるって聞いて、こっそり森に入ったんだよな。","nextNodeIds":[730800120]},{"nodeId":730800120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":718348682,"text":"ああ、そうだ。当時、俺たちはとても心配して、捜索隊を結成し森に入った。","nextNodeIds":[730800121]},{"nodeId":730800121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":774163450,"text":"そうそう！ラナが捜索隊を作ったのはおまえだって言ってた！それにカレーを持っていったんだろ…？","nextNodeIds":[730800122]},{"nodeId":730800122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3824041362,"text":"薬草のことをスダッベに教えたのは誰？","nextNodeIds":[730800123]},{"nodeId":730800123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":3952660626,"text":"…俺だ。スダッベはいい子で、アマディアおじいさんのことをよく気にかけている。あの子と話した時に、そのことを話したのを覚えている。だが、俺はこうも言った…","nextNodeIds":[730800124]},{"nodeId":730800124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":408527930,"text":"おう、オイラ知ってるぞ！「勝手に森に行ったらダメだ」って言ったんだろ。おまえにそう言われたってスダッベから聞いたぞ。スダッベは、本当にアマディアじいちゃんのことを大切に思ってるんだな…","nextNodeIds":[730800125]},{"nodeId":730800125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":2484210074,"text":"…他に何か聞きたいことはあるか？","nextNodeIds":[730800126]},{"nodeId":730800126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":795801050,"text":"えっと…それから、二人目に迷子になったのは誰だっけ？","nextNodeIds":[730800127,730800128,730800130,730800132]},{"nodeId":730800127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2907649506,"text":"カブス。","nextNodeIds":[730800135]},{"nodeId":730800135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":1087482618,"text":"カブス…あの子は妹が失踪した件について、「友達」と相談しようと森に行った。","nextNodeIds":[730800136]},{"nodeId":730800136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3568863642,"text":"そうだな。カブスに物語を話した時、あいつもそう言ってた！アルフォンソ、カブスの友達って誰か、おまえは知ってるか？","nextNodeIds":[730800137]},{"nodeId":730800137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":839922362,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[730800138]},{"nodeId":730800138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":1660102674,"text":"いや、俺も知らないんだ。森でカブスもあの子の友達も見つけられなかったからな。君たちも知っているように、あの子もスダッベと同じく突然帰ってきた。しかし、何も覚えていなかった。","nextNodeIds":[730800139]},{"nodeId":730800139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":3177181962,"text":"まだ何か問題があるのか？その後、子供がいなくなることはなくなったよな。","nextNodeIds":[730800140]},{"nodeId":730800140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":284484194,"text":"パイモンが言ってやって。","nextNodeIds":[730800141]},{"nodeId":730800141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":128008530,"text":"ええ？おう…コホン、次にいなくなるのはイッサムのはずだった、そうだよな？でも、オイラたちとラナはたまたまあいつに会って、助けることができた。","nextNodeIds":[730800142]},{"nodeId":730800142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1152197282,"text":"なぜそんなことが起きたのか？","nextNodeIds":[730800143]},{"nodeId":730800143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4242348290,"text":"ああ…あいつの話だと…アルフォンソから森の洞窟に大きなキノコがあるって聞いたらしいぞ。それを採って、ラナに食べさせようと思ったんだよな。","nextNodeIds":[730800144]},{"nodeId":730800144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2015026418,"text":"でもその道中、ファデュイの悪者に追いかけられて、怖くて逃げた結果、死域に閉じ込められたんだ…","nextNodeIds":[730800145]},{"nodeId":730800145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":758688002,"text":"ん？あいつ、死域に入ったのか…そんな話、俺は聞いてないぞ！危険すぎる、どうしてそんなことに…","nextNodeIds":[730800146]},{"nodeId":730800146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":4183312818,"text":"#いや、違う…あの子が誤って死域に入ってしまったのなら、どうやって無事に帰ってきたんだ？{NICKNAME}は神の目がなくても元素力を扱えるが、あの子は…","nextNodeIds":[730800147]},{"nodeId":730800147,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2749776274,"text":"（えっと…アランラナのこと、アルフォンソに話してもいいのかな？）","nextNodeIds":[730800148,730800149]},{"nodeId":730800148,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2545046010,"text":"（大丈夫。）","nextNodeIds":[730800150]},{"nodeId":730800150,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":991920018,"text":"…アルフォンソ、信じられないかもしれないけど、森には「アランナラ」っていう精霊がいるんだ。イッサムたちとアランナラは友達だから、そいつらがあいつを助けたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[730800151]},{"nodeId":730800151,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":864670810,"text":"アランナラ…","nextNodeIds":[730800152]},{"nodeId":730800152,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2121358850,"text":"でも、ファデュイは本当に悪いやつらだな、子供まで狙うなんて！","nextNodeIds":[730800153]},{"nodeId":730800153,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":838533906,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[730800154]},{"nodeId":730800154,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1220667634,"text":"はぁ…でも、こうして整理してみても、ヴィマラ村に潜む悪者の正体はまだ分からないな…","nextNodeIds":[730800155]},{"nodeId":730800155,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":425111394,"text":"パイモン、誰かに監視されてるみたい。","nextNodeIds":[730800156]},{"nodeId":730800156,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1725698682,"text":"ええ？どこだ！？もしかして、オイラたちが探してる悪者か？","nextNodeIds":[730800157]},{"nodeId":730800157,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1327489450,"text":"パイモンが見てきて。","nextNodeIds":[730800158]},{"nodeId":730800158,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2932506658,"text":"オイラ一人でか…？","nextNodeIds":[730800159,730800160]},{"nodeId":730800159,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1107629442,"text":"何か見つけたら呼んで、すぐ行くから。","nextNodeIds":[730800161]},{"nodeId":730800161,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":252830466,"text":"#ふん、分かったよ。全部{NICKNAME}にやらせるわけにもいかないし、今回はオイラがやるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[730800162]},{"nodeId":730800162,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":646047354,"text":"パイモンはやる気に満ちあふれた様子で飛んでいった。","nextNodeIds":[730800163]},{"nodeId":730800163,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":4075622202,"text":"なぜわざわざ余計なことをする？","nextNodeIds":[730800164,730800165]},{"nodeId":730800164,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":954196914,"text":"知らないほうがいいこともあるから。","nextNodeIds":[730800166]},{"nodeId":730800166,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":1286060762,"text":"場所を変えて話そう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":730800165,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2149879610,"text":"こういうことは、知る必要がない。","nextNodeIds":[730800166]},{"nodeId":730800160,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2458874378,"text":"小さいし空も飛べるから、偵察にぴったり。","nextNodeIds":[730800161]},{"nodeId":730800149,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4108084178,"text":"（彼に知らせるべき。）","nextNodeIds":[730800150]},{"nodeId":730800128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":67669330,"text":"スダッベ。","nextNodeIds":[730800129]},{"nodeId":730800129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1902879546,"text":"いやいや、オイラたち今スダッベのことを話し終えたばかりだろ！たしか、あいつのお兄さんの…カブスだよな？","nextNodeIds":[730800135]},{"nodeId":730800130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3063385234,"text":"イッサム。","nextNodeIds":[730800131]},{"nodeId":730800131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3010377770,"text":"違うだろ？イッサムがいなくなった時、オイラたちが一緒に助けたはずだ…たしか、二人目はスダッベのお兄さん、カブスだよな？","nextNodeIds":[730800135]},{"nodeId":730800132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":726366738,"text":"チャンチャン。","nextNodeIds":[730800133]},{"nodeId":730800133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":234128258,"text":"待て待て、チャンチャンは璃月にいるやつだろ…？チャンチャンとなんの関係があるんだよ！","nextNodeIds":[730800134]},{"nodeId":730800134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3567851250,"text":"#はぁ…大丈夫かよ、{NICKNAME}？たしか、二人目はスダッベのお兄さんで、カブスだったろ？","nextNodeIds":[730800135]},{"nodeId":730800111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2226576314,"text":"カブス。","nextNodeIds":[730800112]},{"nodeId":730800112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":4124788906,"text":"スダッベだったはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[730800119]},{"nodeId":730800113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":349316130,"text":"イッサム。","nextNodeIds":[730800114]},{"nodeId":730800114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":482407770,"text":"いやいや、違うだろ！イッサムは最後にいなくなったやつだ…","nextNodeIds":[730800115]},{"nodeId":730800115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":1910384274,"text":"スダッベだったはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[730800119]},{"nodeId":730800116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":829222882,"text":"ティミー。","nextNodeIds":[730800117]},{"nodeId":730800117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3467680138,"text":"ティミー？おいおい、ティミーは関係ないだろ！それに、あいつはモンドにいるんじゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[730800118]},{"nodeId":730800118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20593,"speakerName":"アルフォンソ","textMapHash":2929885610,"text":"ティミー？…最初にいなくなったのは、スダッベだろう？","nextNodeIds":[730800119]}]},{"talkId":7308003,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},